== mechanism, from the parser's own source ==
   'Summary for Cross <x>' does not match ^Summary for Variable (\S+)$, so the current coverpoint is not updated;
   it matches the generic ^Summary for clause instead, which only clears the in-bins flag. The cross's own
   'Covered bins' heading then re-opens bin parsing while the coverpoint still names the previous Variable.
